  Text: "These are not CCTVs at all, they are cheap webcams disguised as high-tech
    surveillance equipment. \n \nRegardless of that, some are pointing directly at
    us and the <link>truck</link>. \n \nWe should find the main computer to get access
    to any footage captured by those things. \n \nMaybe they saw the crash. "
  TextForRepetition: 'We already tried that, remember?

    The report is probably
    on your desk, or in the DB if you uploaded it.'
